<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01 · 非线性盘旋轨迹：四处闲逛、瞎混等待与四周传阅 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Aimless / Unhurried Movement & All Directions — EPE Ch.10 §2.6-2.7 Fig.10.5</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>65 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.10 §2.6 & §2.7 Figure 10.5)：</b>正如 EPE Figure 10.5 所示，因为 AROUND 的轨迹是转圈或弯曲的（而非笔直冲向目标的直线），它天然适合表达<b>「漫无目的、不慌不忙、闲散或瞎混的行为（Aimless, casual or unhurried behavior）」</b>！如四处闲逛或瞎搞（<i>wander/hang/wait/fool/mess/play around</i>）；转头向四周各个方向看或传阅分发则为（<i>look/pass/hand/ask around</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>look <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>look about oneself</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>look</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span><b>Look</b> <b>around</b> to see whether you can find the missing document.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>1/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be released or become known; of news</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>break, unwrap</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>News of her death broke in the morning.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Inseparable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>around to</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Inseparable'>🔵 不可拆分 (v. + adv. + prep. + O)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>do something despite obstacles such as lack of time</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>do</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>He finally got around to painting the windows.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>2/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [bypass] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>avoid something unpleasant or laborious</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>bypass, avoid</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>You cannot bypass these rules!</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>3/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>move around; move from place to place</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>travel, locomote</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>How does she <b>get</b> <b>around</b> without a car?</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>get <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 4 个核心义项'>4/4</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be a social swinger; socialize a lot</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>swing, socialize</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The situation began to <b>get</b> <b>around</b> unexpectedly.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>1/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>become widely known and passed on</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>spread, circulate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The rumor spread.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The story went around in the office.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>2/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [suffice] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>be sufficient</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>suffice, answer</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>There's not enough to <b>go</b> <b>around</b>.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>3/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [bypass] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>avoid something unpleasant or laborious</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>bypass, avoid</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>You cannot bypass these rules!</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>4/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [revolve] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>turn on or around an axis or a center</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>revolve, rotate</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The Earth revolves around the Sun.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The lamb roast rotates on a spit over the fire.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>go <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 5 个核心义项'>5/5</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [outflank] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>go around the flank of (an opposing army)</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>outflank, travel</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The situation began to <b>go</b> <b>around</b> unexpectedly.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>run <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + [AROUND] 非线性闲散口语图式' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>play boisterously</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>frolic, lark</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The children frolicked in the garden.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The gamboling lambs in the meadows.</div></div>
