<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Formal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>revolve <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Formal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：拉丁/法语学术词根 [revolve]' style='cursor:help;'>🏛️ 正式/书面 (Formal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>center upon</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>center, refer</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Her entire attention centered on her children.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>Our day <b>revolved</b> <b>around</b> our work.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>waltz <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>dance a waltz</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>waltz, dance</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The situation began to <b>waltz</b> <b>around</b> unexpectedly.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Formal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>revolve <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Formal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：拉丁/法语学术词根 [revolve]' style='cursor:help;'>🏛️ 正式/书面 (Formal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>move around in a circular motion</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>circle</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>The Earth <b>revolves</b> <b>around</b> the Sun.</div></div></div></td></tr>
