</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02 · 180度转向与绕行弧线：改变主意、苏醒、规避问题与顺道拜访 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Reversal, Circumvention & Detour — EPE Ch.10 §2.5, §2.7-2.8 Fig.10.6</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>7 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>📖 <b>EPE 认知机制 (Lindstromberg Ch.10 §2.5, §2.7 & §2.8 Figure 10.6)：</b>① <b>旋转改变朝向</b>：不仅身体可以转过来（<i>turn around</i>），人的观点态度也可以转过来同意对方（<i>come/bring/win sb around</i>），昏迷者意识转回来即为苏醒（<i>come around</i>）；② <b>绕过障碍物（Figure 10.6）</b>：遇到岩石或法规限制不硬闯，而是画半圆弧线绕过去即为规避智取（<i>get/work/skirt around a problem</i>）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: turn)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>turn abruptly and face the other way, either physically or metaphorically</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>turn</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>He <b>turned</b> <b>around</b> to face his opponent.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>My conscience told me to <b>turn</b> <b>around</b> before I made a mistake.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>1/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>change one's position or opinion</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>change</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>He came around to our point of view.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>happen regularly</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>hap</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Christmas rolled around again.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Intransitive' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>turn <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 2 个核心义项'>2/2</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Intransitive'>🟠 不及物 (Intransitive)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: better)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>improve significantly; go from bad to good</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>better, improve</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>Her performance in school picked up.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>bring <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>1/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: awaken)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>return to consciousness</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>awaken, wake</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>These pictures bring back sad memories.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>bring <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>2/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: cure)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>provide a cure for, make healthy again</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>cure, heal</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>The treatment cured the boy's acne.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>The quack pretended to heal patients but never managed to.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>bring <span class='pt-highlight'>around</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 3 个核心义项'>3/3</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：作为正式词 [persuade] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>cause to adopt an opinion or course of action</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>persuade</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span>His urgent letter finally brought me around to give money to the school.</div></div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
